# Committed on purpose. Nothing in here is a secret: an origin trial token is
# served to every visitor in the page source, and it is worthless off the
# origin it names. It lives here rather than in .env.local because
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined at BUILD time, so a token that only exists on one
# machine is a token the deployed site does not have.

# Chrome html-in-canvas trial. Registered for https://mythcorp.org with
# subdomain matching, so it covers i.mythcorp.org too.
#
# EXPIRES 2026-10-20. It will fail silently: no error, no log, DecryptReveal,
# RetroDither and Glitch in src/app/components/canvasui/ simply go inert again
# and Asciify drops back to a stale snapshot. Renew at
# https://developer.chrome.com/origintrials before then.
#
# Not covered by this token, each needs its own registration:
#   - the *.workers.dev preview host (different registrable domain)
#   - http://localhost:3000 (register a localhost token to test locally)
